  "description": "The meme uses the metaphor of 'can't swing it' to imply that Trump lacks the physical strength or capability to perform a basic athletic action, which is then extended to suggest he is incompetent in leadership or governance. This metaphor is not directly visible in the image but is understood through cultural knowledge of how physical actions are used to symbolize broader capabilities or failures.",
